                        <div style="line-height:1.3;">
                            <div><span style="font-size:24px; font-weight:900; color:#d4a017;">REAL</span><span style="font-size:24px; font-weight:900; color:#0f1c33;">ERP</span></div>
                            <div style="font-size:10px; color:#94a3b8; letter-spacing:2px; font-weight:600;">SAAS PLATFORM</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <p style="color:#64748b; font-size:14px; line-height:1.9; margin-bottom:24px;">We build modern ERP tools to help you manage and grow your business efficiently.</p>
                    <div class="d-flex gap-3">
                        <a href="#" class="btn fw-bold px-4 py-2" style="background:#d4a017; color:#0f1c33; border-radius:8px; font-size:14px;">Support</a>
